From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jagad <jagad@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:59:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Jagad: enable upstream tablet features by default

Turns on (native default and matching Java CachedFlag defaults):
- AndroidVerticalTabs: vertical tab rail, toggled from the app menu or tab
  strip context menu (horizontal stays the initial layout)
- EnableAndroidSidePanel + EnableAndroidSidePanelManualResizing
- TabSwitcherDragDropAndroid: drag tabs in the tab switcher
- AndroidKeyboardShortcutOpenFile: Ctrl+O
- AndroidDesktopBookmarkLayout / AndroidDesktopHistoryLayout
- AndroidCloseAllTabsRetainsPinnedTabs

All remain switchable in chrome://flags.
---
 .../flags/android/chrome_feature_list.cc      | 24 ++++++++++++-------
 .../browser/flags/ChromeFeatureList.java      |  8 +++----
 2 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/flags/android/chrome_feature_list.cc b/chrome/browser/flags/android/chrome_feature_list.cc
index 78ab792..8f16441 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/flags/android/chrome_feature_list.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/flags/android/chrome_feature_list.cc
@@ -689,12 +689,15 @@ BASE_FEATURE(kAndroidBricksNativePage, base::FEATURE_DISABLED_BY_DEFAULT);
